Z||000008||88 Database Nut||04-11-2000||11:10 AM||||Wisky,<P>Say, that is different from both of my 88GTs.  I run the '88 Database, can you give me your VIN and a brief description of your car?  I'd like to add this small Variation to my list of things which changed during the model year.  I didn't know that this spacer was in other years Oreif, I'm going to check my friends 87GT and see if his has it (low mileage car, all original).  This little thread sure is interesting.<BR>WisconsinGT, how about detaching the EGR tube and pulling the EGR valve out to see what this spacer looks like.  Surely it wasn't someone's "fix" of a leaky EGR tube?||||reg||3
